/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can now explore virtual locations by teleporting between intersections and places." = "Ara podeu explorar ubicacions virtuals teletransportant-vos entre interseccions i llocs.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can select waypoints from your markers." = "Pots triar punts d'interès des de la teva llista de marcadors.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can teleport between nearby intersections and places to understand their relative distances." = "Podeu teletransportar-vos entre interseccions i llocs propers per explorar les seves relacions de distància.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can try searching by name or address." = "Pots provar de buscar per nom o adreça.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can turn off sound effects for specific POI supercategories while keeping their spoken announcements." = "Podeu desactivar els efectes de so per a supercategories de PDI específiques, permetent que només s'anunciï el text del PDI";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can turn off the entry and exit sound effects used by exploration commands." = "Podeu desactivar els efectes de so d'entrada i sortida per explorar ordres.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can't delete a marker while a beacon is set on it." = "No podeu suprimir un marcador mentre sigui la balisa actual.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can't delete a route while it is being used for guidance." = "No podeu suprimir una ruta mentre us proporcioni orientacions.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You have changed the waypoints in this route." = "Has canviat els senyals d'aquesta ruta.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You will be teleported to the location you selected." = "Seràs teletransportat a la ubicació que hagis seleccionat.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You will be teleported to the middle of the street near the selected location. Hold the phone like a pointer and turn slowly to hear street names. When you face the street you want to follow, tap Go to advance to the next intersection." = "Seràs teletransportat al mig del carrer a prop de la ubicació que hagis seleccionat. Utilitzant el telèfon com a punter, gireu lentament i els noms dels carrers es cridaran a mesura que gireu. Quan estiguis davant del carrer pel qual vols baixar, toca Anar i avançaràs a la següent intersecció.";

